A system effective to encapsulate a substance with graphene, the system comprising:
a first container including graphene oxide and water;
a second container including at least one reducing agent and the substance;
a third container in operative relationship with the first container and the second container, at least one processor in communication with the first container, the second container, and the third container, wherein the processor is configured to control the third container to receive the graphene oxide and water from the first container;
control the third container to receive the reducing agent and the substance from the second container;
control the third container to mix the graphene oxide, water, reducing agent, and
substance under sufficient reaction conditions to produce graphene; and
control the third container to mix the graphene oxide, water, reducing agent, and
substance under sufficient reaction conditions to produce sufficient graphene to encapsulate the substance with the graphene to produce a graphene encapsulated substance.

